codex
The failure is now isolated: this sandbox’s process PID namespace and mounted `/proc` disagree (`getpid()` names a nonexistent `/proc/<pid>`), while Lean 4.22 resolves its executable via `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`. `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m applying a narrow preload compatibility shim that rewrites only that procfs executable lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter Lean sources, the generated project, or proof behavior. I’ll record the probe, shim source, and rerun in full.
